Package: terrax
Type: Package
Title: TerraX Earth-Observation Tools from R
Version: 2.0.0
Description: Runs TerraX's tools (forest loss, burn severity, land cover,
    terrain, hydrology, canopy height and biomass, radar change, disturbance
    dating) on local files from R, through the 'terrax' command, and returns
    their results and output files (GeoTIFF, GeoJSON, CSV) for use with
    'terra' and 'sf'.
License: MIT + file LICENSE
Encoding: UTF-8
Imports: jsonlite
Suggests: terra, sf
SystemRequirements: the terrax command (pip install -e backend from the TerraX repository)
